Subject: [PATCH 03/54] ngram-bias: add logit-steering sampler (bias_logits)
 over static n-gram cache

Steers logits via logits[token] += alpha * ln(p) from a pre-built n-gram
lookup table. Bias config: n-grams 2-4, stupid backoff (longest match first).
Flags: --ngram-bias-cache FNAME, --ngram-bias-alpha N.
